topic:
This unit has expanded and enhanced almost every skill represented on the professional development PDF. Having already received an internship and thus entering the engineering workforce I take any opportunity to improve my professional skills extremely seriously. In my previous reflection I discussed how my initiative and willingness to make decisions in the face of uncertainty had been significantly improved throughout Engg 1050. Furthermore, I gave insight into how this course has improved my professional behaviour and the need for any individual to understand goals and boundaries. Today I will continue my discussion of the transferable skills that I have gained by demonstrating how I have gained insight into the need for; 

_ACCOUNTABILITY IN A TEAM OPERATION_

This skill has been challenged and enhanced throughout Engg 1050 due to the team nature of our task. This skill is essential in any workplace as it cultivates a team that understands the expectations of the brief while allowing for individual creative expression and aims to improve communication throughout. I strive to continue to improve on my accountability within teams throughout my journey into the workforce and throughout my university course.
